BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:8929954bb703291cd6a0f45dfb1d286c0824e05a@pushpin.city
DTSTAMP:20261121T135110Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261121
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261122
SUMMARY:LPR Presents: Rising Appalachia with support from Viv & Riley
LOCATION:National Sawdust\, 80 N 6th St\, Brooklyn\, NY 11249
DESCRIPTION:In Appalachia\, farmers still practice the ancestral tradition 
 of companion planting. Corn grows tall as a trellis\, beans climb the corn
 \, and squash provides the ground cover. Rising Appalachia cultivates a si
 milar symbiosis in their music\, where Southern folk traditions\, New Orle
 ans swamp culture\, and Atlanta’s street spirit strengthen each other. K
 nown for their seamless harmonies\, songcatching and storytelling\, the ba
 nd has released ten albums and toured throughout North America\, South Ame
 rica\, Europe\, the Celtic Isles\, Australia and beyond — performing eve
 rywhere from the Telluride Bluegrass Festival and Red Rocks to NPR’s Tin
 y Desk. All the while\, the band has cultivated a devoted grassroots follo
 wing traveling to communities big and small by train\, horseback\, bio-die
 sel bus and sailboat.\nhttps://www.nationalsawdust.org/event/lpr-presents-
 rising-appalachia-with-support-from-viv-riley\nFrom Pushpin NYC: https://p
 ushpin.city/nyc/
URL:https://www.nationalsawdust.org/event/lpr-presents-rising-appalachia-wi
 th-support-from-viv-riley
END:VEVENT
