DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261210
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261211
SUMMARY:Hildegard Commission Concert 2026
LOCATION:National Sawdust\, 80 N 6th St\, Brooklyn\, NY 11249
DESCRIPTION:The Hildegard Commission Concert returns with groundbreaking pr
 emieres from our four winners\, today’s most exciting rising composers
 —che buford\, Līva Blūma\, Fjóla Evans\, and Maria-Eduarda Mendes Mar
 tin—along with works from our four brilliant finalists. The namesake of 
 our commission\, 12th-century mystic Hildegard von Bingen\, used vivid\, i
 ntricate miniature drawings in her prophetic books to bring complex spirit
 ual visions to life. For this year’s commission\, our winners have compo
 sed music that directly responds to a distinct illustration from Hildegard
 's codices. These historic images will be brought to life through dynamic 
 animations and projections from a visionary visual designer\, transforming
  the performance space into an interactive ecosystem of sight and sound. S
 tep into a multi-sensory\, immersive environment inspired by the extraordi
 nary legacy of the 12th-century mystic Hildegard von Bingen.\nhttps://www.
 nationalsawdust.org/event/hildegard-commission-concert-2026\nFrom Pushpin 
 NYC: https://pushpin.city/nyc/
URL:https://www.nationalsawdust.org/event/hildegard-commission-concert-2026
END:VEVENT
