SUMMARY:National Sawdust Presents: Silkroad Up-Close featuring Kaoru Watana
 be and Layale Chaker
LOCATION:National Sawdust\, 80 N 6th St\, Brooklyn\, NY 11249
DESCRIPTION:Silkroad Up-Close offers a closer look at some of the extraordi
 nary artists who make up the Silkroad Ensemble and at the ideas\, traditio
 ns\, and relationships that shape their work. Created as an intimate count
 erpart to Silkroad’s large-scale concert presentations\, this flagship s
 eries gives Ensemble members the space to lead: inviting collaborators\, t
 racing musical lineages\, and developing programs rooted in their own crea
 tive lives. The result is a portrait of Silkroad from the inside\, reveali
 ng not only the breadth of traditions represented within the Ensemble\, bu
 t the curiosity and exchange that continually transform them.\nhttps://www
 .nationalsawdust.org/event/national-sawdust-presents-silkroad-up-close-fea
 turing-kaoru-watanabe-and-layale-chaker\nFrom Pushpin NYC: https://pushpin
